    ju "– Itu sebabnya aku mencintaimu. Anda ahli dalam \'meringankan suasana hati.\'"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_d497ae33:


    she "– Saya tidak keberatan \'meringankan\' Anda. Tugas-tugas ini sudah membuatku… mmm…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_b7a313a2:


    em "– Shelly, itu sudah cukup!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_0cc67d42:


    ty "– Tunggu… Justin, apa kamu suka kalau istrimu menggoda seperti ini… dengan orang yang hampir tidak dia kenal?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_0da7fdeb:


    ju "-Mengapa tidak? Dia adalah wanita yang berjiwa bebas dan percaya diri. Itulah sebabnya aku jatuh cinta padanya."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_6dbd6217:


    she "– Dan apa pendapatmu, Tyler, terhadap kebebasan dalam hubungan?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_1f958eea:


    ty "– Tergantung pada 'kebebasan' seperti apa yang Anda bicarakan."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_bef88e3d:


    she "– Membiarkan diri Anda menggoda, melihat orang lain, memberi tahu mereka perasaan Anda yang sebenarnya… Mungkin bahkan lebih dari itu?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_efdd47d8:


    em "– Oke oke! Shelly, berhenti menambahkan bahan bakar ke api. Kami di sini untuk bersantai, dan saya… menjadi sedikit tegang."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_23ea4cf9:


    she "– Pernahkah kamu menjadi pusat perhatian dua pria sekaligus?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_e843790b:


    em "(berpikir) Mungkin… Shelly tahu lebih banyak daripada yang dia ungkapkan? Apakah Justin memberitahunya… semuanya? Atau bisakah dia menemukan jawabannya sendiri?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_6492cbd4:


    em "– Saya tidak tahu tentang Anda… tapi satu saja sudah cukup bagi saya."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_72b90a19:


    ju "– Dia benar, sayang, jangan dipaksakan. Tidak semua orang seliar Anda."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_7ec36ca2:


    she "– Mungkin, mungkin…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_8cb0e523:


    em "– Kita bisa minum-minum dan bersenang-senang tanpa membicarakan siapa yang melihat siapa atau siapa menginginkan siapa."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_7a547b47:


    she "– Melangkah keluar dari kebiasaan dengan alasan yang masuk akal adalah hal yang baik. Saat itulah Anda merasakan bumbu kehidupan."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_680f8a5a:


    ju "– Ayo kita minum. Untuk tidak takut mencicipi hidup."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_f4eed7f1:


    ty "– Aku ikut. Tapi… Shelly, kali ini mari kita jaga agar tetap jinak, oke?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_80c077a8:


    she "– Roti panggang yang luar biasa!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_5bf4ef98:


    ju "– Ngomong-ngomong, bagaimana kalian menyukai kota kecil kami? Tidak menyesal pindah?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_ab19e251:


    em "– Tidak menyesal, tapi saya masih menyesuaikan diri. Bergerak… itu sangat membuat stres. Rasanya seperti memulai hidup dari awal."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_d2a2853e:


    ty "– Ini tidak terlalu dramatis, jika Anda bertanya kepada saya. Emma mendapat pekerjaan baru. Segalanya seharusnya menjadi lebih mudah sekarang."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_d30d0e9c:


    she "– Pindahan memang merepotkan dan mahal, tapi saya yakin Anda akan berhasil."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_ce73c2af:


    em "– Semoga begitu. Kami mencoba menyelamatkan. Tyler sudah dua tahun tidak berlibur, selalu bekerja… Seharusnya aku meringankan bebannya lebih cepat."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_d9db4b13:


    she "– Tunggu sebentar… Saya baru saja mendapat ide…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_c646944f:


    she "– Seorang teman baik saya memiliki studio foto di pusat kota. Mereka sedang mengadakan audisi untuk model-model baru sekarang."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_28f83c68:


    she "– Emma, kamu benar-benar cantik! Mengapa tidak mencobanya? Ini bisa menjadi cara yang bagus untuk menghasilkan uang dan menemukan diri Anda sendiri."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_5abfe59a:


    em "– Seorang model? Aku? Ayolah, itu bukan kesukaanku…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_4c30a369:


    ty "– Mungkin bukan ide bagus. Emma perlu fokus pada pekerjaan barunya. Dunia modeling… Saya skeptis…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_24ad3815:


    em "– Tunggu… Apa maksudmu aku tidak cukup baik untuk menjadi model?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_fbc6034c:


    ty "– Bukan itu maksudku, sayang. Hanya saja industri itu… Anda tahu rumor tentangnya."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_55002bac:


    em "– Jadi menurutmu aku tidak bisa melakukannya tanpa tidur nyenyak?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_8e80b766:


    she "– Ya Tuhan, Tyler, serius?! Stereotip-stereotip kuno itu sudah lama hilang!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_15e77bd9:


    she "– Studio teman saya benar-benar profesional dan aman. Tidak ada seorang pun yang akan menekan Emma atau menyeretnya melakukan apa pun. Atau apakah Anda takut dia… tidak bisa menahan godaan?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_edca432f:


    ty "– Ayolah, bukan itu yang aku khawatirkan."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_f364c082:


    she "– Saya yakin Emma bisa berhasil jika dia ingin mencobanya. Mengapa tidak? Tidak ada yang mengatakan itu harus menjadi karier seumur hidup."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_2580c0df:


    she "– Ini adalah peluang besar untuk menghasilkan uang dan meningkatkan kepercayaan dirinya, itu saja."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_208a3156:


    ju "– I think Emma's not the type to let anyone push her around or force her into anything. She's got a strong character."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_468bb674:


    em "– Five minutes ago, I'd probably have said 'no'… But now—I'm in!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_36dbf364:


    ty "– Alright… If this matters to you, I'll support you. But only if truly desire it"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_865f5bc2:


    she "– Now that's the talk of a real man!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_4_bb8c0efb:


    em "– Thanks, honey."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_0bff8748:


    em "– That was a nice get-together."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_665b7e2c:


    she "– Yeah, it was fun. We should hang out sometime without the guys. I'd show you how to be a bad girl."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_95980723:


    ty "– Shelley…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_06486cc3:


    ju "– Tyler, need a hand?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_dfe6ab99:


    ty "– Relax, neighbor. I've got this."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_7f04608d:


    em "– Really, no need, we'll clean up ourselves."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_00e07084:


    she "– Emma, in that case, mind if I sunbathe here at your place?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_16af11ed:


    em "– Make yourself at home, of course. Want me to grab some sunscreen?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_after_b408bcc1:


    she "– That'd be awesome."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_menu_dc33d1b2:


    em "(thoughts) Who should I talk to?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_9674b898:


    em "– Justin…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_641f009d:


    ju "– Sit down. Wanna talk about something?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_1bdb1bdd:


    em "– You know… I still feel kinda awkward. After everything."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_c60c0bc4:


    ju "–Tentang apa? Sejauh yang saya ketahui, semuanya baik-baik saja."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_4bce966f:


    em "– Just… you had to explain yourself because of me."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_28759c7e:


    ju "– Oh, that's what you mean… It's nothing. I'm just glad things are good between you and Tyler."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_8a1d00a1:


    em "– Justin, listen… that story…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_e46bc232:


    ju "– Which one?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_526c48df:


    em "– Ha… You know, it's kinda funny to me now when I think back. But at the time… honestly, it was no laughing matter."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_933fbcec:


    ju "– Okay… Sounds like you're not talking about the bar now."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_7864eb29:


    em "– About the shower."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_94002609:


    ju "– Oh… Hmm… Yeah, not much to laugh about when you're panicking. And you were definitely freaking out then."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_9f1d331a:


    em "– No kidding! If Tyler had seen you…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_dd42fbc2:


    ju "– He's a bit jealous, no doubt. But on the other hand… seems like a decent guy."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_ef0686ea:


    em "– I was really thrown off back then. The fact that I got undressed… and then…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_6da7151b:


    ju "– Oh, yeah! That was unforgettable!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_34197eaf:


    em "– Justin!"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_208980bf:


    ju "– I'm kidding, don't get mad."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_13913d80:


    em "– I'm so embarrassed when I think about it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_situation_3dbf7382:


    ju "– No need to be."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_f57b8aba:


    em "– Justin, I… just wanted to say 'thank you' again. For everything back then…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_6d93999a:


    ju "– No need, Emma, seriously. Any decent guy in my shoes would've done the same. Your Tyler, for example."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_4ec3cd86:


    em "– Still… what happened… I don't know how to explain it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_78a1ddc6:


    ju "– No need to explain. That time was full of emotions. You were on edge, and you'd had a drink."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_679c1377:


    em "– You're… probably right. It was just… a tough moment."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_df2ea197:


    ju "– Look, let's agree we were both a bit out of it back then. Don't beat yourself up."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_11de6ccc:


    em "– I was about to stop myself, but…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_6661f119:


    ju "– You don't have to apologize. And you definitely shouldn't feel guilty. Between us, everything's fine, honestly. But our better halves don't need to know about it… at least not yet."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_4838d5c2:


    em "– Thanks, Justin. That means a lot to me."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_335cc938:


    ju "– You're amazing, Em. And I think Tyler's damn lucky to have you."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_4e1b6e45:


    em "– Really?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_00cb5847:


    ju "– Honestly… for the first time since I met Shelly, I was that close to cheating. Had to pull myself together to avoid something… we'd probably regret later."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_kiss_1eccb4b2:


    em "– Probably, yeah, Justin. You're right."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_7207b1cd:


    em "– Your Shelly is something else. She's so cool."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_9881b87b:


    ju "– That's true. Shelly's a real whirlwind. You never know what she'll do next. Never a dull moment with her."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_ad71f4b2:


    em "– Even her jokes… They're so… bold."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_9237c68a:


    ju "– She's just confident in us. We've been through a lot together, and it's toughened our bond."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_0ade28cf:


    em "– Sounds like something special. That kind of confidence… those relationships are rare."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_d9122aa8:


    ju "– It's all about trust, Em. When you know you can rely on someone close, everything else doesn't matter as much."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_0407f6a8:


    em "– I guess that's… hard."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_b2cd7c76:


    ju "– Sometimes I feel like Shelly's missing something, like married life weighs her down."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_8eb6c0bf:


    em "– How do you know?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_shelley_df99e812:


    ju "– I just see it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_4a1ca9ec:


    em "– What do you think of Tyler?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_79cf70b3:


    ju "– Seems like a solid guy. Not the 'wear his heart on his sleeve' type, but he's honest when he speaks. I respect that."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_36a2811b:


    em "– He can be a bit grumpy, shuts down sometimes. But deep down, I feel Tyler's caring and kind. It's just… sometimes it's like we're speaking different languages."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_40365029:


    ju "– I've seen guys like that."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_ea4a8850:


    em "– Maybe it's my fault? Have I stopped being interesting to him?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_9f191f59:


    ju "– I don't buy that for a second. You couldn't be uninteresting. Sometimes… people just lose their connection. Something glitches, that's all. Not because either of you isn't trying."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_c86cbe24:


    em "– Maybe… He works a lot, gets tired, and I… I'm trying to find ways to keep our relationship going. It doesn't always work."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_f13f4d85:


    ju "– Sometimes the simple stuff works. A talk, a small gesture. Just be there—that's it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_062437bf:


    em "– Do you think I'm too focused on 'fixing everything' instead of just being with him?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_895e8f4a:


    ju "– You need to believe in yourself. You're doing all you can. If he's lucky, he'll see it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_a86ff142:


    em "– Thanks, Justin. You're a real friend."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_just_tyler_92b18703:


    ju "– Always here to listen if you need it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_end2_b6641401:


    em "– You know… I really enjoy talking to you."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_end2_302c75f0:


    ju "– Same here, with you."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_end2_61e8baa3:


    em "– So, we'll find a few more things to chat about next time?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_end2_7c4808bb:


    ju "– Hundred percent."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_e74ec295:


    em "– You're insanely awesome, Shelly."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_f6d83255:


    she "– Thanks, Em, but what did I do?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_3c36eeb2:


    em "– You're confident, vibrant… You're the kind of person I'd love to be."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_7e192fda:


    she "– The thing is, you can be anyone you want. It's just a matter of wanting it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_f58c244e:


    em "– I really do want to… but sometimes I get lost."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_0350efa0:


    she "– Sit next to me."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_22d7712f:


    she "– Lost in what? In yourself? In your relationship?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_459dd53e:


    em "– Both, I guess. Things with Tyler can be tough. Sometimes it feels like he only sees me as the woman who cooks and cleans, not… all of me."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_5d1114ed:


    she "– And do you show him all of you?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_8e107539:


    em "– What do you mean?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_1a61c448:


    she "– Men are simple creatures. You've got to remind them who you are every now and then. If you don't, they'll forget."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_95c610d7:


    em "– So how do you do that with Justin?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_10a5aaa3:


    she "– First, I'm never afraid to be myself. Second, I love knocking him off his feet with something unexpected. A new outfit, words, an action… Like now: chilling here, sunbathing, and he can't help but look."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_32160585:


    she "– So I was thinking… What kind of guys do you even like? Or liked, back before Tyler?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_83122265:


    em "– Well… I think I always liked guys like him. Polite, caring, reliable…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_3fbb75c3:


    she "– Just those kinds, and that's it? Hmm… Are you being honest right now?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_f5456f00:


    em "– We-ell… Okay, maybe… not entirely."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_f5829965:


    she "– Aha! Spill it, come on."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_2da1f331:


    she "– Emma, could you rub some sunscreen on my back?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_ecbd9949:


    em "– Sure, no problem, turn around."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_9f162513:


    em "– Before Tyler, I was into different types. More… you know… tough, buff guys."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_44615ba6:


    she "– Rugged?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_a892c3a6:


    em "– Yeah… I guess. Strong. The kind that make you feel like they could protect you from the whole world. But that was before. Then I met Tyler, and everything changed."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_2ce2e2d2:


    em "– With him, I realized true strength isn't in chiseled muscles, but in who you are inside. I love him… for who he is."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_b0c12bf3:


    she "– Sounds like you found your guy."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_6c28513e:


    em "– I'm sure I did. And I'm grateful to fate for it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_1814e49c:


    she "– And you never, ever go back to those old fantasies?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_208bf3c2:


    em "– They're in the past. I have everything I need."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_7011b203:


    she "– Thanks, Emma, you've got magic hands."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_2ab2fa03:


    em "– Tyler's checking you out too."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_cbe9da30:


    she "– Really? Thanks, I'll take it as a compliment."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_1da8ec2d:


    em "– And that… doesn't bother you at all? Justin's seeing Tyler look too."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_2a7eed90:


    she "– Not one bit. It's awesome, Emma! Let Justin see that other guys want me. It just makes him more into me."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_11a3de54:


    em "– You sure? Jealousy can push guys… to do all sorts of things."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_f3a03b1a:


    she "– A little jealousy doesn't hurt. As long as it's channeled right. Guys love competition, even if they won't admit it."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_4fcf195b:


    em "– I… never really thought about it like that."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_06fdbf53:


    she "– Trust me, there's nothing worse than a woman who doesn't believe she's wanted. If you don't believe in yourself, how's your husband supposed to?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_57de4961:


    she "– Sometimes it's enough to just change how you see yourself. A drop of confidence in your own appeal works wonders."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_f80b7c38:


    em "– Maybe… I should try being bolder too?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_0eed6d2b:


    she "– Of course! Start small: wear something that'll make Tyler see you in a new light. Or do something unexpected."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_1051920d:


    em "– Like what?"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_5dcdd346:


    she "– Sunbathe with me here."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_984affdc:


    em "– Sure… Hold on, I'll grab my swimsuit…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_c201a805:


    she "– That wouldn't be unexpected."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_44e1915b:


    em "– Wait… What are you talking about? I don't have…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_a7ae4d31:


    she "– Exactly."


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_3b3972b2:


    em "– You're crazy…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_e2d88136:


    em "– But then again…"


translate english day4_justin_shelley_talk_shelley_dc0ab250:


